"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4425720","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3440510-1845383656396919","game_id":"steam-3440510","kind":"update","title":"Devlog #3: Demo Update, Narrated Trailer & Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hey everyone!Sorry for the long silence! It’s been a while since my last news post, but I’ve been hard at work on Zap Colony, and there’s some good progress to share!The updated demo is live!The latest update brings an improved tutorial, balance adjustments, and more polished visuals and sound effects.I’ve also added six new languages: German, Spanish, Brazilian Portuguese, Simplified Chinese, Russian, and Japanese, alongside the previously available English and Polish.Getting ready for Steam Ne","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T16:01:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396919","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3440510-1826362059930840","game_id":"steam-3440510","kind":"announcement","title":"Zap Colony Demo Updated for Steam Tower Defense Fest","summary":"Hello everyone!Zap Colony is part of Steam Tower Defense Fest, and the demo has just received a major update! The biggest change is a completely rebuilt tutorial. One of the most common issues players had with the previous version was understanding the game’s core rule: tower color must match enemy color. For example, if you want to target red enemies, you need to supply the tower with red energy.Because of that, I reworked the opening experience from the ground up:information is introduced in a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-09T17:00:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059930840","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3440510-1825093633187912","game_id":"steam-3440510","kind":"announcement","title":"Zap Colony Demo is LIVE ⚡","summary":"Hey everyone!Zap Colony Demo is now live here on Steam and you can jump right in to defend your colony from the ever-growing numbers of Starclops!If you’re new here: Zap Colony is a minimalist strategy game best described as “Mini Motorways meets Tower Defense” - a mix of route planning and resource management, all happening in a randomly growing, real-time colony defense simulation (with active pause).This demo comes after a very helpful playtest period, and I’ve already implemented a lot of im","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-20T14:07:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825093633187912","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3440510-1823825466499784","game_id":"steam-3440510","kind":"announcement","title":"Open Playtest is LIVE!","summary":"Hey everyone! The open playtest for Zap Colony⚡ is live right now and you can jump in immediately.The playtest will run for about a week. After that I’ll be working on fixes and improvements, and then we’ll move into the public demo (in about two weeks if everything goes smoothly). Goal of the playtestThis build is already pretty polished (and it’ll get even better), so the main goal is feedback on:Does the game launch and run correctly on your setup?Are the rules clear enough?How does the onboa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-06T14:35:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823825466499784","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3440510-1809235871752205","game_id":"steam-3440510","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #2: Meet the Zap Colony Galactic Crowd","summary":"Zap Colony development is progressing nicely and I've been working lately on game UI, menus and controls. I also decided that since the game progression focuses on getting high scores and climbing the galactic leaderboards, I want the top-tens to be populated with some interesting characters that will bring some life and character to the Zap Colony universe.After some doodling in Adobe Illustrator, below you can see a first batch of characters I came up with. As you can see, Zap Colony galaxy is","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-02T15:08:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1809235871752205","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3440510-1806698490682235","game_id":"steam-3440510","kind":"update","title":"Devlog #1: Zap Colony Debut Trailer & Progress Update","summary":"Hello everyone and welcome to my first devlog and announcement on Zap Colony⚡! Today is a big milestone! Just as Steam is rolling out the new video player, I’m releasing the first game trailer, so you can finally see the game in action. The trailer is based on early development builds, but it already gives a glimpse of what Zap Colony is all about and what minimalist style I’m striving for. Have a look and give it a Like if you enjoy what you see :) The trailer is quite representative of the cur","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-31T13:12:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1806698490682235","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3440510":{"last_a